{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_021mat_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_021mat_8001_p", "source_sha256": "25db821cb52146527326e27315ebed0ec75984a17f5e0874d7d3fead9bec493f", "ja": "（アイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』のグラビア企画で、\nまつりが交通安全パレードに参加することになった）", "zh": "（在偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》的写真企划中，\n小松丽决定参加交通安全游行。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_021mat_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_021mat_8002_021mat", "source_sha256": "3f4786099bbde4decdb3373a1d8aa62befe76609518b5d9fa39b71049819e99b", "ja": "姫の王国のパレードを思い出すのです♪　今日は\n警察官のみなさんと、交通安全を呼びかけるのですよ！", "zh": "这让我想起公主王国的游行了呢♪　今天\n要和各位警察叔叔阿姨一起，宣传交通安全哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_021mat_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_021mat_8003_p", "source_sha256": "728f91a8b613e726641af17bc3723eb2b3b6adf7739c48d1dc63a3fa21c3253e", "ja": "ああ、頑張ろう！　パレードの最後に\nスピーチをしてもらう予定だから、よろしくな。", "zh": "啊，一起加油吧！　计划让你在游行最后发表演讲，就拜托你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_021mat_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_021mat_8004_021mat", "source_sha256": "a1a4cd745e35c53473fa71e88465b42965ad2710b6b7a379e29a55d6299524d4", "ja": "はいなのです！　でも、どんなお話をすればいいか\nちょっと悩んでいるのです……。", "zh": "好的！不过，要讲什么样的话才好呢，我有点苦恼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_021mat_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_021mat_8005_021mat", "source_sha256": "b5057ad12897c0b3010136525a4ddf85173b6c85e4e9898426102b220854c874", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\nアドバイスをくれるとうれしいのです。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，要是能给我一些建议，我会很开心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_021mat_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_021mat_8006", "source_sha256": "b36bc5ed60bd858199cc8ec87f434921d9761dec379b2f52e62851973d4d8437", "ja": "交通ルール", "zh": "交通规则", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_021mat_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_021mat_8007", "source_sha256": "328c5619dc9691169614640ef02ae02d8a64f38f2b02a2de1a6928db0998ea95", "ja": "心がけていること", "zh": "平时注重的事项", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_021mat_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_021mat_8008", "source_sha256": "7e6b6bc6f3a43d13906a0ac872a71095f9d27b65a60169c41ec066c9babb64ff", "ja": "あいうえお作文", "zh": "用“あ”“い”“う”“え”“お”开头的作诗", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_021mat_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_021mat_8100_p", "source_sha256": "e364dea3c93c9af0004adb31c3bf63e725e490d0a9d1da85aa480a1809c0e5f9", "ja": "交通ルールについて話してみるのはどうだ？\n大切なことなんだって、改めて感じてもらえると思う。", "zh": "要不要聊聊交通规则？\n这样应该能让大家再次感受到遵守交通规则的重要性。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_021mat_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_021mat_8101_021mat", "source_sha256": "1da7e82fcda2e072ec4f5317141790fa8a24c99d291c7cba525521ef372dc6a9", "ja": "それは名案なのです！　姫がお話すれば、\nみんなもきっと笑顔で聞いてくれるのです！", "zh": "这主意真棒！　只要本公主来讲，大家一定会笑着听的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_021mat_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_021mat_8102_021mat", "source_sha256": "91cf4c9dec7bba2bfeb08107c9289cff84b0ab874c6bdb6c79a7dd1a5261ccd3", "ja": "みんながルールを守れば、毎日が安心安全……\nすーぱー・ぴーすほー！になるのですよ♪", "zh": "只要大家都遵守规则，每天都会安心又安全……\n变得超级和平哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_021mat_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_021mat_8200_p", "source_sha256": "31704fe680fca0347f48bdf8856261c635137e6713fa19f068150f1d622ba57f", "ja": "日頃から心がけていることを話すのはどうだ？\n体験談が一番参考になるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "聊聊平时一直注意的事情，怎么样？\n亲身经历最有参考价值了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_021mat_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_021mat_8201_021mat", "source_sha256": "7d953a568e99a8ef378378775d8fa5bb5ec5466b381a7e921f3abb7641d148fa", "ja": "なるほど……。姫自身のお話をするのですね。\nそれなら簡単なのです！", "zh": "原来如此……是要讲公主自己的事情啊。那就简单了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_021mat_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_021mat_8202_021mat", "source_sha256": "1dfcc6691261f22a9c092feedd451a94de9d215aab6535926016c3a0254e850a", "ja": "姫のお話、{$P$}さんも\nちゃんと聞いていてくださいね？　……ね？", "zh": "公主说的话，{$P$}先生也要\n好好听着哦？……好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_021mat_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_021mat_8300_p", "source_sha256": "ef784c1f895581ae2758592b4e67390082a57d5f19b26e0ffe496cd25e69dbe6", "ja": "あいうえお作文で交通安全を呼びかけるのはどうだ？\n集まった人達も楽しんで聞いてくれると思うんだ。", "zh": "用藏头短诗来呼吁交通安全怎么样？\n我觉得聚集起来的人们也会开心地听。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_021mat_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_021mat_8301_021mat", "source_sha256": "b220eb945caa9f52013d505f368155031efaacbb04e20b3821a7d3c6b2b89979", "ja": "ナイスアイディア！　と言いたいところですが……\nもうすぐパレードが始まってしまうのです～！", "zh": "好主意！本来想这么说的，可是……\n游行马上就要开始了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_021mat_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_021mat_8302_021mat", "source_sha256": "faf352f9a0c07e680276023f0171528394210c225fcf372a16e21c4b164e8095", "ja": "ううっ、{$P$}さん！\nもっと早く言ってほしかったのです～！", "zh": "呜呜，{$P$}先生！\n人家想让你早点说的嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
